# Tutorial, the other Auction Counters of step 6: Prog 6 (a GM). Each counter: Option 1 (already 1 after the first: the
# same write), the auction menu (player:sendMenu(AUCTION)), noAction. Aht Urhgan Whitegate, Bastok Mines, Eastern
# Adoulin, Lower Jeuno, Port San d'Oria, Ru'Lude Gardens, Western Adoulin, Windurst Walls (Bastok Markets', Southern San
# d'Oria's and Windurst Woods' are the nation flows'). Prog 7 (a GM): a counter: the check fails: its script.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Auction_Counter/onTrigger BastokMines/Auction_Counter/onTrigger EasternAdoulin/Auction_Counter/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Auction_Counter/onTrigger PortSanDoria/Auction_Counter/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Auction_Counter/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/Auction_Counter/onTrigger WindurstWalls/Auction_Counter/onTrigger
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=-136,-7,73.9 job=WAR lvl=1 nation=1
charvar HQuest[Tutorial]Prog 6
login
trigger Auction_Counter                 # Option 1; the menu; noAction
warp -15.9,-4.1,-46.4 BastokMines
trigger Auction_Counter
warp -21,-0.6,-90 EasternAdoulin
trigger Auction_Counter
warp -16,-0.1,-30 LowerJeuno
trigger Auction_Counter
warp 3,-9.3,-149 PortSanDoria
trigger Auction_Counter
warp -74.7,5.6,2.7 RuludeGardens
trigger Auction_Counter
warp -68.2,2.8,-88 WesternAdoulin
trigger Auction_Counter
warp 56,-3.6,-54.5 WindurstWalls
trigger Auction_Counter
charvar HQuest[Tutorial]Prog 7          # a GM
trigger Auction_Counter                 # the check fails: its script (the auction house)
finish-if-event
